## Installing by hand

```bash
sudo apt-get install -y {{ node_prep_staging_dir }}/*.deb
sudo apt-mark hold kubelet kubeadm kubectl
```

`apt-mark hold` matters: an unattended upgrade that moves kubelet a minor
version out of step with the control plane will break the node.

Verify:

```bash
kubeadm version
kubectl version --client
systemctl status containerd --no-pager
```

kubelet will restart-loop until `kubeadm init` or `kubeadm join` runs. That is
expected at this stage -- it has no configuration yet.
